OL,3,GNEWSAPaul McCartney in height plea over
OL,4,ABeatles films
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Paul McCartney has recalled how he
OL,7,Fmade a personal plea to the director of
OL,8,Fupcoming films about the Beatles to not
OL,9,Fportray him smaller than John Lennon as
OL,10,Fthey were similar heights in real life.
OL,12,FThe 84-year-old is set to be portrayed
OL,13,Fby the Gladiator II star Paul Mescal in
OL,14,FThe Beatles ` A Four-Film Cinematic
OL,15,FEvent, which is being directed by Sir
OL,16,FSam Mendes.
OL,18,FBut after being sent a recreation of
OL,19,Fthe famous Abbey Road crossing,
OL,20,FMcCartney joked that he complained that
OL,21,FMescal was "markedly shorter" than the
OL,22,FLennon actor.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
