OL,5,
OL,6,FHe told the Good Hang with Amy Poehler
OL,7,Fpodcast that Mendes sought to reassure
OL,8,Fhim by saying they were all the same
OL,9,Fsize, and it was "just the stride
OL,10,Fpattern".
